      <h1 class="h-xl">Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:18px">Please read this before using anything you find on this site.</p>

      <h2>This is not medical advice</h2>
      <p>{{ site.name }} is a student research project. It is written for education and for sharing what published research says. It is not medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment, and it is not a substitute for talking to a qualified healthcare professional.</p>
      <p>The person who writes this site is a student, not a doctor, a dermatologist, a nurse, a therapist, or any other licensed professional.</p>

      <h2>Talk to a professional</h2>
      <p>If you have a concern about your skin, your mood, or your health, speak to a doctor, a dermatologist, a school nurse, a counsellor, or an adult you trust. Never start, stop, or change a treatment because of something you read here, and never delay getting help because of something you read here.</p>

      <h2>About the research we summarize</h2>
      <p>We link to the studies we write about so you can read them yourself. Summaries are our own reading of that research and may simplify it. Research can be limited, can disagree with other research, and can be updated or corrected after we write about it. Always check the original source, which is listed in our <a href="/research/#library">Research Library</a>.</p>

      <h2>About the interviews</h2>
      <p>Interviews reflect the views of the person being interviewed at the time we spoke to them. They are lightly edited for length and clarity. They are not medical advice and do not create a professional relationship between that person and you.</p>

      <h2>If you are struggling right now</h2>
      <div class="crisis">
        <p><strong>If you are in immediate danger, call 911.</strong></p>
        <p><strong>988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline</strong> &#8212; call or text <strong>988</strong>, any time, free and confidential. Chat at <a href="https://988lifeline.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">988lifeline.org</a>.</p>
        <p><strong>Crisis Text Line</strong> &#8212; text <strong>HOME</strong> to <strong>741741</strong>.</p>
        <p>You can also talk to a parent, a school counsellor, a teacher, or your doctor. Asking for help is a normal thing to do.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
      <p>We link to outside pages, including research databases and journals. We do not control those sites and are not responsible for their content or their privacy practices.</p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>If something here is wrong, out of date, or unclear, please tell us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> and we will correct it.</p>

